ably or cause malfunction, and may expose the VCAP pins to unsuitable signal activity.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.99\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The schematic routes both MCUs' required VCAP connections onto external signal nets and shows no VCAP bypass capacitors. This is a substantive power-integrity and connectivity error likely to impair MCU operation.\"\n}",
